# WTDRV.KEY - the key script of the Windows test driver's test,
# TEST/WTDRV.C, run by "WIN WTDRV /KEYS:WTDRV.KEY /SNAP:WTDRV.SNP"; every
# mode of Windows writes TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/WTDRV.SNP.
S START
# A name with a CP437 letter, typed into the edit control.
T Zo‰ Lee
S TYPED
# TAB to the check box, SPACE checks it.
K TAB SPACE
S CHECKED
# The mnemonic of Add: the name becomes a row.
K ALT-A
S ADDED
# ALT-F opens the File menu, D its Dialog item: a modal dialog; the
# password typed shows as stars, ENTER closes it through OK.
K ALT-F
S MENU
K D
T secret
S DIALOG
K ENTER
S DIALOGOK
# The mnemonic of About opens the dialog again, ESC closes it.
K ALT-B ESC
S CANCEL
# CTRL-K, an accelerator, checks Marked in the Options menu.
K CTRL-K
S MARKED
# F5 starts work that holds the driver until it is done.
K F5
S WORKED
# Exit through the menu: the program ends with no window left.
K ALT-F X
S GONE
